cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Tapeline, please cite it as below."
title: "Tapeline: camera poses and room reconstruction from video"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Gabdullin
    given-names: Bulat
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4112-0300"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/bulatko/tapeline"
keywords:
  - structure-from-motion
  - bundle adjustment
  - monocular depth
  - TSDF fusion
  - indoor reconstruction
abstract: >-
  Video-to-room pipeline: frame selection, VGGT-Omega pose prior, SuperPoint+LightGlue
  matching with DINOv2 retrieval, GPU triangulation and bundle adjustment, posed
  Depth Anything 3 depth, metric scale and per-frame scale, gravity-aligned world
  with the floor at zero, TSDF fusion with a visibility map, export, stage gates and a
  provenance manifest.
